WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.300
[Music]

2
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:19.600
Flapjack: Hi, I’m Flapjack.

3
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.600
Can you help me get ready for school?

4
00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:23.840
I can’t find my clothes.

5
00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:27.940
I wonder if my sister Flo
knows where my shoes are.

6
00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.760
Ah, her door is shut.

7
00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:34.020
What should I do?

8
00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:37.020
Should I knock on the door?

9
00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:39.840
Good idea!

10
00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.660
I’ll knock and ask if I can go in.

11
00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:47.400
Knock, knock.

12
00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:49.480
Flo, may I come in, please?

13
00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:54.190
Flo: Why, sure, Flapjack.

14
00:00:54.190 --> 00:00:55.790
Thank you for asking.

15
00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:57.600
Come on in.

16
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.800
Flapjack: Oh, there’s my shoes.

17
00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:03.760
Can you help me get them?

18
00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:08.220
Good job.

19
00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:10.600
Thanks for helping me find my shoes.

20
00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:14.800
Now I need to go to Bo’s room
and see if he has my pants.

21
00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:19.600
Oh, Bo’s door is shut too.

22
00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:22.420
Hmm, what should I do?

23
00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:28.210
Should I knock on the door?

24
00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:33.050
Should I just go in?

25
00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:37.670
Help me choose.

26
00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:41.830
Oh, good idea.

27
00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:44.630
I’ll knock and ask if I can go in.

28
00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:50.930
Knock, knock.

29
00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:53.290
Bo, may I come in, please?

30
00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:58.490
Bo: Well, Flapjack, yes, you may come in.

31
00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:01.690
Flapjack: Hey, there’s my pants.

32
00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:04.590
Can you help me get them?

33
00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:07.810
Great, thanks.

34
00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:10.630
Now I just need to find my shirt.

35
00:02:11.350 --> 00:02:12.610
I think I know where to look.

36
00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:14.550
I’ll check in Jo’s room.

37
00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:20.440
Oh, Jo’s door is shut too.

38
00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:22.800
What should I do?

39
00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:25.920
Should I knock on the door?

40
00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:31.500
Should I just go in?

41
00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:37.050
Should I yell?

42
00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:43.000
Help me choose.

43
00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:49.550
Hey, good idea.

44
00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:52.290
I’ll knock and ask if I can go in.

45
00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:56.850
Knock, knock.

46
00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:58.390
Jo, may I come in, please?

47
00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:02.320
Jo: Oh, sure, Flapjack.

48
00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:03.600
Come on in.

49
00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:07.880
Flapjack: Hey, there’s my shirt.

50
00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:10.780
Can you help me get it?

51
00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:21.110
Now I have my shirt,
my pants and my shoes.

52
00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:22.950
Now I can get dressed for school.

53
00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:26.700
But first, let’s dance!

54
00:03:26.900 --> 00:04:01.500
[Music]
